# Snapshot API — run the existing Demo engine over HTTP

FastAPI service that wraps the SIH26054 Demo engine for the React dashboard.

## Run

```bash
cd snapshot_api
python -m venv .venv && . .venv/bin/activate
pip install -r requirements.txt
PYTHONPATH="$PWD/.." uvicorn app.main:api --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8000
```

The `PYTHONPATH` points at the SIH26054 repo root so `app.engine` can import
`Demo.telemetry.generator`. Adjust for your layout.

## Endpoints

- `GET /health` — liveness.
- `GET /api/scenarios` — list of scenario keys.
- `POST /api/snapshot` — generate a snapshot.

## CORS

Set `ALLOWED_ORIGINS` to the origins that may call this API (comma-separated).
Defaults to localhost dev servers.
